der Stelle: <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L. 43 § 10 de ritu<lb/>
nupt.</hi> (23. 2.). &#x201E;Senatus cen-<lb/>
suit, <hi rendition="#i">non conveniens esse</hi> ulli<lb/>
Senatori, uxorem ducere aut<lb/>
